        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of significant intellectual impairment and adaptive behavior deficits with onset during developmental period",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is clinical but supported by genetic testing when available."
